  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till MR-institutet HURID i syfte at etablera institutet och genom institutets aktiviteter f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra polisk&#xE5;rens och domstolsv&#xE4;sendets MR-medvetande samt st&#xE4;rka MR-utbildningen vid University of Zambia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Human Rights Institute, HURID, i order to establish the institute and through HURID&apos;s activities improve the knowledge of human rights among the Zambian police and Judiciary and to strengthen the human rights education at the University of Zambia.</narrative>
  </description>
